ASL Alphabet Recognition

Real-time sign-to-text system using MobileNetV2, PyTorch, OpenCV, and Flask.

Features
- Real-time webcam recognition
- Browser-based UI
- Word and sentence construction
- 29 gesture classes
- Transfer learning

Results
- >99% validation accuracy
- 100% accuracy on provided ASL test samples

Tech Stack
- Python
- PyTorch
- OpenCV
- Flask

Run
pip install -r requirements.txt
python demo.py
